# This site

**rempelautomation.com** is a public B2B marketing site for Rempel Automation. It sells trust to operations people (growers, packers, shippers), not consumer splash.

## Stack (locked)

| Layer | Choice |
|---|---|
| Language | **TypeScript** only (`.ts` / `.vue` `lang="ts"`). Strict. No app `.js`. |
| UI | Vue **3.5+** Composition API, `<script setup lang="ts">` |
| Types | `@vue/tsconfig` + `vue-tsc --noEmit` (Vite does not typecheck) |
| Build | Latest **stable** Vite + `@vitejs/plugin-vue` |
| Routing | **Vue Router 5**, file-based pages under `src/pages/` |
| CSS | **Tailwind CSS 4** via `@tailwindcss/vite` |
| SEO | Build-time **prerender** of every public URL (vite-ssg or equivalent) |
| Host | Static files on a serverless host (Cloudflare Pages preferred) |
| Forms | Optional Worker/function in TypeScript. No always-on app server |

Not this project: Nuxt, Vue 2, Options API, Laravel/PHP, DaisyUI, a CMS, untyped JS, or Pinia (add Pinia only if real shared client state appears).

## Non-negotiables

- Serverless: static HTML/CSS/JS from a TypeScript build. No long-running Node or PHP process.
- One look: pages compose shared layout + section components. Do not restyle a page in isolation.
- Modern: current stable Vue 3.5, TypeScript 5.8+ (`@vue/tsconfig`), Vite, Router 5, Tailwind 4. No alpha/beta unless Dan asks.
- TypeScript strict. No `any`. See `typescript.mdc`.
- Read `.cursor/skills/vue3-marketing-site/SKILL.md` and `.cursor/skills/vue3-component-reuse/SKILL.md` before adding UI.

Exact versions: latest stables that satisfy each other's peer ranges at install time. Check changelogs on major bumps.
